## ⚖️ Vertical vs Horizontal Scaling

| | Vertical Scaling (Scale Up) | Horizontal Scaling (Scale Out) |
|---|---|---|
| What | Add more CPU/RAM to existing server | Add more servers |
| Pros | Simple | No hard limit, highly available |
| Cons | Hard limit, single point of failure | More complex |
| Best for | Low traffic, simple setups | Large scale applications |

