## ⚡ Load Balancer

Evenly distributes incoming traffic among web servers.

```
                    [Public IP]
User ──────────→  Load Balancer
                  /           \
        [Private IP]       [Private IP]
        Web Server 1       Web Server 2
```

**Benefits:**
- Eliminates single point of failure
- If Server 1 goes down → all traffic to Server 2
- Auto-scales: add servers, load balancer routes automatically
- Uses **private IPs** between load balancer and web servers (security)

