## 🚀 Cache

A temporary storage area for expensive responses or frequently accessed data.

```
Web Server
    │
    ├── Check Cache ──(hit)──→ Return to Client
    │        │
    │       (miss)
    │        ▼
    └── Query Database → Store in Cache → Return to Client
```

**Cache strategy:** Read-through cache

### Cache Considerations

| Consideration | Details |
|---|---|
| **When to use** | Data read frequently, modified infrequently |
| **Expiration policy** | Not too short (DB overload), not too long (stale data) |
| **Consistency** | Keeping cache & DB in sync is hard across regions |
| **SPOF** | Use multiple cache servers across data centers |
| **Eviction Policy** | LRU (most popular), LFU, FIFO |

> ⚠️ Cache is volatile — don't store critical persistent data only in cache!

