## 📨 Message Queue

A durable, in-memory component for **asynchronous communication**.

```
Producer/Publisher → [Message Queue] → Consumer/Subscriber
    (web servers)                        (workers)
```

**Use case — Photo Processing:**
```
Web Server → [Queue: photo-jobs] → Photo Workers (scale independently)
```

**Benefits:**
- Producer & consumer **scaled independently**
- System remains available if one side is down
- Loose coupling → more resilient

